.228" end="02:16.719">Na</span><span begin="02:17.224" end="02:17.682">u</span><span begin="02:18.195" end="02:18.620">ka,</span><span begin="02:19.173" end="02:19.695">Tvorche</span><span begin="02:20.205" end="02:20.654">stvo,</span><span begin="02:21.205" end="02:21.655">Se</span><span begin="02:22.171" end="02:22.627">mya,</span><span begin="02:23.195" end="02:23.672">Soyuz</span></text><text for="L14"><span begin="02:24.160" end="02:24.622">Ob</span><span begin="02:25.158" end="02:25.653">ra</span><span begin="02:26.175" end="02:26.654">zo</span><span begin="02:27.156" end="02:27.655">vanie,</span><span begin="02:28.192" end="02:28.703">Ko</span><span begin="02:29.194" end="02:29.661">mmu</span><span begin="02:30.137" end="02:30.626">nal</span><span begin="02:31.159" end="02:31.357">ka,</span><span begin="02:31.357" end="02:31.711">Trud</span></text><text for="L15"><span begin="02:32.104" end="02:32.651">Di</span><span begin="02:33.182" end="02:33.719">stsi</span><span begin="02:34.050" end="02:34.726">pl</span><span begin="02:35.059" end="02:35.746">ina,</span><span begin="02:36.019" end="02:36.701">Pla</span><span begin="02:36.962" end="02:37.706">ni</span><span begin="02:38.049" end="02:38.690">rov</span><span begin="02:39.020" end="02:39.661">ka,</span><span begin="02:39.967" end="02:44.024">Dobrota</span></text><text for="L16"><span begin="02:44.024" end="02:45.865">Ro</span><span begin="02:45.865" end="02:46.958">dina</span><span begin="02:46.958" end="02:47.033">–</span><span begin="02:47.033" end="02:48.009">poem</span><span begin="02:48.009" end="02:50.095">tebe</span></text><text for="L17"><span begin="02:50.095" end="02:51.082">V</span><span begin="02:51.082" end="02:52.076">verno</span><span begin="02:52.076" end="02:53.524">sti</span><span begin="02:53.524" end="02:55.078">klyanem</span><span begin="02:55.078" end="02:56.105">sya</span></text><text for="L18"><span begin="02:56.105" end="02:58.117">Prole</span><span begin="02:58.117" end="03:01.331">tarii</span><span begin="03:01.331" end="03:01.757">vsekh</span><span begin="03:01.757" end="03:02.142">stran</span><span begin="03:02.142" end="03:04.146">Soe</span><span begin="03:04.146" end="03:05.359">d</span><span begin="03:05.359" end="03:05.794">inyai</span><span begin="03:05.794" end="03:06.182">te</span><span begin="03:06.182" end="03:08.102">s</span></text><text for="L19"><span begin="03:08.102" end="03:09.638">Serp</span><span begin="03:09.638" end="03:09.796">i</span><span begin="03:09.796" end="03:10.182">Molot</span></text></transliteration></transliterations><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">镜中苏联蓄势待发</text><text for="L2">先手得势争做赢家</text><text for="L3">虚假的自由终将付出代价</text><text for="L4">代理战争穿插，间谍尔虞我诈</text><text for="L5">太空竞赛，春秋笔法</text><text for="L6">勃列日涅夫与李根相持不下</text><text for="L7">底牌核弹令人生畏</text><text for="L8">毁灭一切只为自相残杀</text><text for="L9">力量与谋略</text><text for="L10">造就了伟大的苏维埃联盟</text><text for="L11">爱国者们在秩序中团结一心</text><text for="L12">未来注定是我们的天下</text><text for="L13">科研，创造，为国为家</text><text for="L14">教育，公共，投身劳动</text><text for="L15">秩序，计划，兼济天下</text><text for="L16">此曲献山河</text><text for="L17">此歌为祖国</text><text for="L18">联合起来，全世界的无产者</text><text for="L19">高举锤子镰刀，燃起燎原之火</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="03:10.182"><div begin="00:08.148" end="03:10.182"><p begin="00:08.148" end="00:15.717" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:08.148" end="00:08.704">С</span><span begin="00:09.231" end="00:09.710">С</span><span begin="00:10.218" end="00:10.685">С</span><span begin="00:11.201" end="00:11.662">Р</span> <span begin="00:12.216" end="00:12.697">в</span> <span begin="00:13.218" end="00:13.712">зер</span><span begin="00:14.258" end="00:14.692">ка</span><span begin="00:15.253" end="00:15.717">ле</span></p><p begin="00:16.221" end="00:23.700" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:16.221" end="00:16.688">Кто</span> <span begin="00:17.213" end="00:17.689">